%8B%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fopen.oceanengine.com%2Flabels%2F7%2Fdocs%2F1834161681551499%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%E2%80%8B%3Cspan%20style%3D%5C%22color%3A%20%232f54eb%3B%5C%22%3E%3Cem%3E%E3%80%90%E8%BF%9B%E9%98%B6%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%EF%BC%9A%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%97%B6%E6%95%88%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E3%80%91%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fspan%3E%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fa%3E%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-aSxPbLmk\">本文介绍巨量引擎开放平台<strong><u>频控限制规则</u></strong>：所有 API 都施加了频控限流策略，一共包含3层</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-LWXPhXJ0\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-HNa0abfR\"><span style=\"color: #595959;\"><em>如需了解“如何基于被分配的QPS开发限流器”，详见此文档</em></span><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710758840332\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #2f54eb;\"><em>【基础实践：频控限流器开发】</em></span></a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-5GO9elOT\"><span style=\"color: #595959;\"><em>如需了解高频请求场景下，如何调度可提升数据同步时效，详见此文档</em></span><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1834161681551499\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #2f54eb;\"><em>【进阶实践：高频请求时效优化】</em></span></a></li></ul></div></div></div><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-JD7Da5OO\" id=\"h490b8bf-JD7Da5OO\">一、 什么是频控</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-w9cO9Hn7\">单位时间（目前均为秒级，即qps）内请求接口的次数限制。目前开放平台有3种频控限制，分别为：客户频控、开发者频控、接口总频控</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t75ae23f-dHJTDccK\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-Hab8BU9p\"><col data-id=\"c74a5ab8-28RiiS4K\" span=\"1\" width=\"15.244596131968146%\"/><col data-id=\"c3a2ced5-j3cDkLWE\" span=\"1\" width=\"34.129692832764505%\"/><col data-id=\"c57a63f7-8mALT9bV\" span=\"1\" width=\"50.62571103526735%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-5u0NIrgz\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-pVKfAO8g\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tab294e0-mbsjKeDa\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"background-color: rgb(233, 233, 233); vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZNZwXq37\"><strong>频控类型</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"tab294e0-NYOTSJIR\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"background-color: rgb(233, 233, 233); vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-nvGuZczZ\"><strong>介绍</strong></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t06d92d6-BXjeN7KY\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"background-color: rgb(233, 233, 233); vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-tbZrzxfu\"><strong>超限限制</strong></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-1OR18FaE\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-AeEx0HMT\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mBSwcrbN\">客户频控</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-r5QUL3So\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-g2UwOAta\">客户单位时间内请求单接口请求次数限制</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t00cbcc2-rwdgieOQ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2UVqRJEz\">超限报错错误码为<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">40130</code> ，客户频次先于开发者频控发生，不会占用开发者频次。</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-4oY4KRXx\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-MS9BVjmU\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7tI2nkZH\">开发者频控</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-jL4KxuMK\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-LknQET4R\">开发者单位时间内请求单接口请求次数限制</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-BaNg4g6q\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7U6rGMuH\">超限报错错误码为<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">40110</code> ，可查看开发者自身频控限制范围，调整请求频次在自身频控范围内</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-yVM5vUtT\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t1c8f800-0DGtIhBR\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-0Ow4qzBL\">接口总频控</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t1c8f800-K18af0eu\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-QDy8Tn3t\">单位时间内所有开发者请求单接口次数限制</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"t16089ba-5ipnnDNC\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vET4Zg1M\">超限报错错误码为<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">40100</code> ，系统总频控由系统动态调整，可在开发者频控范围内重试，或错峰，避免整点或半点峰期使用。</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tYZpJ%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-yj7PvEXu%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3Eqps%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%8C%BA%E9%97%B4%E4%B8%BA%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E8%87%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E5%89%8D%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%92%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%8C%BA%E9%97%B4%E5%86%85%E7%9A%84%E6%80%BB%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%AC%A1%E6%95%B0%EF%BC%8C%E9%9D%9E%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E7%A7%92%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yj7PvEXu\"><strong>qps计算时间区间为当前请求至请求前一秒时间区间内的总请求次数，非自然秒</strong></p></div></div></div><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-n4pDelQi\" id=\"h490b8bf-n4pDelQi\">二、 如何查看频控</h2><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-Blk1kib7\" id=\"h6f20189-Blk1kib7\">2.1 客户频控</h3><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-OLc3T0NY\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-dVPcVofm\">定义：客户（advertiser_id）维度设置了秒级频控限制，<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">目前仅被开放平台标记为「不活跃账户」的客户受此维度限流管控，</span>建议您提前查询<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1834548530596872\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">【获取不活跃账户列表】</a>接口（此接口查询结果为T+1，可在次日10点后更新同步），在请求前预过滤。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-mXdnpYnp\">建议：不活跃账户基本不会产生数据变动（例如没有进行营销投放则不会产生营销数据），不建议高频次频繁更新获取。<strong>降低无效请求量会正向影响后续新版开发者频控分配</strong>。</li></ul><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-left\"></div><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-right\"></div><div class=\"table-content-scroll\" style=\"overflow-y: scroll\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"true\" data-id=\"t49383ef-7dm709LP\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"880px\" style=\"width: 880px; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-JxHjHt3R\"><col data-id=\"ccfd8b2f-Uf1UK49E\" span=\"1\" width=\"134\"/><col data-id=\"c59aa9e8-KjHTVWNC\" span=\"1\" width=\"450\"/><col data-id=\"c76dd44d-fbCY51Ko\" span=\"1\" width=\"295\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-wEdNx9NO\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-zC55oxJW\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-9fntflD3\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fV0lZqd0\">标签类型</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-lUF3Dsq4\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2iVzAOA6\">判定标准</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-Aq0hV68C\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2lfO7TUd\">更新规则</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-IOC5e7aq\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t8e94736-Cyq06ngZ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-NkynxOjO\">不活跃账户</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t8e94736-iNfleFMq\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-PwOJLWPK\">客户在90天内没有任何活跃行为，结合消耗、项目/营销创编、余额、有无开启中计划等条件综合判断</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t5bc59a3-aVUmsP0w\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZT0WIIjl\">根据客户行为实时变动（峰期会有15-30分钟延迟）</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-Pv7ouynD\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\"><strong>注意</strong></span><strong>：</strong>由于<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1834548530596872\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">【获取不活跃账户列表】</a>接口查询结果为T+1，会存在接口查询结果未更新，但实际投放账户已激活解除限流的情况。</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y92SL%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-3RUDH14X%5C%22%3E%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E9%A2%91%E6%8E%A7%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E6%8B%A6%E6%88%AA%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%8D%E5%8D%A0%E7%94%A8%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85%E7%BB%B4%E5%BA%A6%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%91%E6%8E%A7%E9%A2%9D%E5%BA%A6%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-zvl0Y4Qv%5C%22%3E%E5%8D%B3%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85%E9%A2%91%E6%AC%A1%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%E4%B8%BA30qps%EF%BC%8C%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%86%85%E5%8F%91%E8%B5%B725%E6%AC%A1%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%EF%BC%8C%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AD3%E6%AC%A1%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%98%AF%E7%94%B1%E4%BA%8E%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E7%BB%B4%E5%BA%A6%E9%A2%91%E6%8E%A7%E6%8B%A6%E6%88%AA%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99%EF%BC%8C%E9%82%A3%E4%B9%88%E8%AF%A5%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%86%85%E5%B7%B2%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85qps%E4%B8%BA22%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%98%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%86%8D%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A08%E6%AC%A1%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-3RUDH14X\">客户频控规则拦截的请求数不占用开发者维度的频控额度</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-zvl0Y4Qv\">即：开发者频次限制为30qps，窗口时间内发起25次请求，其中3次请求是由于客户维度频控拦截报错，那么该窗口内已使用的开发者qps为22，还可以再增加8次请求</p></div></div></div><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-96JulXgp\" id=\"h6f20189-96JulXgp\">2.2 开发者频控</h3><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-OCck4VNZ\" id=\"hce1b53f-OCck4VNZ\">开发者频控查询方法</h4><p data-id=\"p838747a-Ctm1lFns\">开发者频控可在开发者后台-账号管理-频控管理处查看（如下图：<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/developer/admin/qps\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">前往查看</a>），此列表为您提供以下信息说明</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-hi9wUvZf\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p3-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/113512a3d1de44468aa738f948c2ecc5~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2071188082&amp;x-signature=YtBZotpWTMbMhslzkXTsEpJ5amU%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\"/></p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-left\"></div><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-right\"></div><div class=\"table-content-scroll\" style=\"overflow-y: scroll\"><table class=\"data-table\" data-custom=\"true\" data-id=\"t965bc8b-AZNZWXDK\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"880px\" style=\"width: 880px; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-OQkZ9hmV\"><col data-id=\"c6f27f9f-AGQG8B0o\" span=\"1\" width=\"155\"/><col data-id=\"ceee19c2-DTJ2YDM6\" span=\"1\" width=\"430\"/><col data-id=\"ceb07266-SB6Ienne\" span=\"1\" width=\"293\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-eiP9a1f7\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-uaTRXVPR\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"te5b348d-yqc4oHei\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-55YC4V58\"><strong>开发者频控相关信息</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"te5b348d-uJA4xSSb\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-E4pkDYwl\"><strong>定义</strong></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t0c8947a-WbWVejh4\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-EFpk4POr\"><strong>数据时效</strong></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-dNaa2t7D\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-PhDk9oiV\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-hsW8eHIS\">开发者频控配额</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-byuWIZ1d\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Hn9RVqxv\">您的开发者账户当前在该接口下被分配的请求QPS配额</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-jCizcm76\">QPS按滑动窗口计算每秒您的开发者账户在该接口下的最大请求次数(超频错误码=40110)</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-nlWh8Dkh\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mTAPgScL\"><strong>实时数据</strong>，代表您当前的真实配额</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-QaKwl4t7\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-8PzKbtIZ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-aJ4DniS4\">近30天频控用量</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-VNLNDzdU\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-OezFFjpm\">代表您近30天在不同接口下的平均QPS用量情况</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-BrUjjjhP\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-nOGswNoZ\">请注意，该指标是一个基于30天平滑计算的参考值，旨在反映长期趋势，<strong>不会与您感知到的实时峰值或短期波动完全吻合</strong></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-WcKnT3xD\"><strong>建议：</strong>实际请求时请根据返回的错误码（40110）或响应头X-RateLimit-Dimension等来判断是否已触发开发者频控限流</li></ul></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-C9DPI5zP\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-I09V8V7l\">该<strong>指标非实时值</strong>，每日更新一次</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-8wC3vM2J\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t8e94736-rjQh50AE\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-KdjGWSTA\">频控状态</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t8e94736-gZ2UCYbB\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-c1A9taGW\">开发者频控状态反映了您在接口下的配额提升资格，有两种情况：</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-CUWo100x\"><strong>🟢 支持提频</strong></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-p3tUXwO8\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-l0Lvgnnq\"><strong>含义</strong>：您的开发者账户表现良好，已获得更高配额资格。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ApfYCiIf\"><strong>操作</strong>：在“操作列”点击确认，新配额才会生效，确认后通常需等待 <strong>5分钟正式生效</strong></li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZvxyN5fz\"><strong>🔴 不支持提频</strong></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-fyHveKVR\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-MUD79Vtu\"><strong>含义</strong>：目前暂未符合提频条件，通常原因如下：</li></ul><ul data-id=\"udcdd064-pPeCEVLJ\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-TrMQH3Af\"><strong>配额充足</strong>：当前配额仍有富余，无需提升</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-W1uoheXM\"><strong>已达上限</strong>：已达当前可分配的最高配额，无法再提升</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-pWRFwpNY\"><strong>未到提频时间点</strong>：请等待系统于每月 <strong>1日</strong> 或 <strong>15日</strong> 的定期评估</li></ul></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t5bc59a3-uaqIZZ7U\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dhH6cjPn\">仅<strong>每月1日、15日9点后</strong>更新周期性评估结果</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-X2p9kYrN\"><br/></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p data-id=\"pa028eb2-dINRHYWR\"><br/></p><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-7OdKbgLd\" id=\"hce1b53f-7OdKbgLd\">如何提升开发者频控</h4><p data-id=\"p838747a-s34jJWjC\">系统周期性评估开发者近期请求情况，符合提升条件接口则会在【开发者后台】-【账号管理】-【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/developer/admin/qps\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">频控管理</a>】处展示提频入口</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-left\"></div><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-right\"></div><div class=\"table-content-scroll\" style=\"overflow-y: scroll\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-col-header\" data-custom=\"true\" data-id=\"t60b399b-gBOMZkli\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"879px\" style=\"width: 879px; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-ofiJbbby\"><col data-id=\"c20006e1-gCaZ05f0\" span=\"1\" width=\"114\"/><col data-id=\"c7bcd689-mGhkdhcG\" span=\"1\" width=\"765\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-eTRK32Rb\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-zCX3zJ5X\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-FAAl2Ou4\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZjvVWF3V\">评估周期</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-sRskyepZ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZG3CIEnO\">每月1日、15日更新评估结果，更新时间一般为9点以后</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-Psx3ZdZa\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-hBG4eM5X\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2BnkqywR\">分配规则</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t00cbcc2-c0fpYSQp\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5vpfEnSC\">为保障平台系统安全和公平性，我们无法提供具体的评估计算公式。请您理解，该评估机制由多个维度综合计算得出，旨在为所有开发者提供一个稳定、健康的开发环境。我们将尽可能确保分配公正、持续优化。</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-ASJSLMFZ\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t1c8f800-ueJ8jFgQ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-BQkiKgSZ\">请求建议</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row table-last-column\" data-id=\"t0513538-eBoNu501\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZHXsMjZi\">设计接口请求方案时，遵循以下规则利于评估分配qps量级</p><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-VmMZpOOG\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-T37bIx7M\"><strong>减少不活跃账户量级</strong>。优先服务有消耗或有操作行为的账户，减少不活跃账户的冗余请求</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-owQpXZeo\"><strong>保障请求合理性。</strong>例如针对实际没有操作投放的投放账户，减缓查询频次；在做增量更新时利用接口提供筛选能力，主动筛选更新内容；接入SPI消息通知能力，被动获取系统变动通知后针对性请求。</li></ol><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vCoXM%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-neg6yhSo%5C%22%3E%E9%A2%91%E7%B9%81%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E4%B8%8D%E6%B4%BB%E8%B7%83%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E5%B0%86%E8%A7%A6%E5%8F%91%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E6%9C%BA%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8D%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E6%8F%90%E9%A2%91%EF%BC%8C%E9%95%BF%E6%9C%9F%E5%B0%86%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E9%99%8D%E4%BD%8E%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85%E9%A2%91%E6%8E%A7%E9%85%8D%E9%A2%9D%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-neg6yhSo\">频繁请求不活跃账户将触发系统保护机制，导致系统判断不支持提频，长期将可能降低您的开发者频控配额。</p></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-beYeXxGu\"><br/></p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-2AVObmRM\" id=\"h6f20189-2AVObmRM\">2.3 接口总频控</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-5GOt31QC\">接口总频控是<strong>由系统动态调整，非固定值</strong>。单位时间内所有开发者请求汇总的限制，并非单独针对某一个开发者请求，权重优先级高于开发者自身频控，一般峰期时间段可能会出现总频控限制报错。</p><h4 data-id=\"hce1b53f-iW5JN6Ql\" id=\"hce1b53f-iW5JN6Ql\">如何提升接口总频控</h4><p data-id=\"p838747a-T2AJkCLF\">接口总频控与您的开发者账户无关，由系统动态调整。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-eHORIOkb\"><br/></p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-te9Gvpbp\" id=\"h490b8bf-te9Gvpbp\">三、 频控惩罚说明</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-0YEziayw\">当按滑动窗口计算每分钟，您的开发者账户在该接口的总请求次数需＜开发者QPS配额*100，超过则将触发持续5分钟的报错惩罚(超频错误码=40110)，届时您可根据响应头进一步调整请求策略</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22X-RateLimit-Dimension%EF%BC%9A%E9%99%90%E6%B5%81%E7%BB%B4%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%8C%20developer_qpm%20%5CnX-RateLimit-Limit%20%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%86%E9%92%9F%E7%BA%A7%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%AC%A1%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%8A%E9%99%90%20%3D%20%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85QPS%E9%85%8D%E9%A2%9D*100%5CnX-RateLimit-Remaining%EF%BC%9A%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85%E5%88%86%E9%92%9F%E7%BA%A7%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E5%89%A9%E4%BD%99%E7%94%A8%E9%87%8F%20%EF%BC%88%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%E6%98%AF0%EF%BC%89%5CnX-RateLimit-RetryIn%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%93%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E8%A2%AB%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85%E9%A2%91%E6%8E%A7%E9%99%90%E6%B5%81%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%AD%89%E5%BE%85%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%80%E7%9F%AD%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%88s%EF%BC%89%22%2C%22disabled%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%22Oz5nd%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content plain\"></div></div></div></div><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fErQi%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-CUrkWlfI%5C%22%3E%E9%A2%91%E6%8E%A7%E6%83%A9%E7%BD%9A%E4%BB%85%E5%9C%A8%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E8%B6%85%E8%BF%87QPS%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%9A%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%86%85%E6%8C%81%E7%BB%AD%E9%AB%98%E9%A2%91%E6%AC%A1%E8%BE%BE%E5%88%B0%E5%88%86%E9%92%9F%E7%BA%A7%E5%88%AB%E4%B8%8A%E9%99%90%E6%97%B6%E8%A7%A6%E5%8F%91%E3%80%82%E8%A7%A6%E5%8F%91%E5%90%8E5%E5%88%86%E9%92%9F%E5%86%85%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E5%B0%86%E5%8F%97%E6%83%A9%E7%BD%9A%E6%9C%BA%E5%88%B6%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E8%80%8C%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99%E5%A4%B1%E8%B4%A5%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CUrkWlfI\">频控惩罚仅在请求超过QPS限制，且在一定时间内持续高频次达到分钟级别上限时触发。触发后5分钟内所有请求将受惩罚机制影响而全部报错失败。</p></div></div></div><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-PQkYOhHi\" id=\"h490b8bf-PQkYOhHi\">Q&amp;A</h2><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-mZLYi6kJ\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-PY95ljJz\"><strong>Q: 如何识别不活跃账户？</strong></li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-q1eEilf5\"><strong>A:</strong>  贵方可自定义账户活跃度标准（例如无操作超过7天的账户），避免对这些账户进行频繁轮询。也可参考查询<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1834548530596872\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">【获取不活跃账户列表】</span></a>接口（此接口查询结果为T+1，可在次日10点后更新同步），在请求前预过滤</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-CyMpdwGD\"><br/></p><ol data-id=\"oa950d4e-KCK1R6Pd\" start=\"2\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-yokipdr0\"><strong>Q：“不活跃账户”和“30天无消耗账户”有什么区别？</strong></li></ol><ol data-id=\"oacb21b4-OUHbTh7B\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-RzDXfAPJ\"><strong>不活跃账户</strong></li></ol><ol data-id=\"odaa5e75-eXEXOADd\" data-indent=\"2\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-TAOzojC7\"><strong>定义</strong>：指长期（如至少90天）无任何商业活动的投放账户，通常会综合<strong>无消耗、无新建/编辑行为、无余额、无开启中计划</strong>等多个条件判断。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ymlxJ822\"><strong>强烈建议</strong>：请您<strong>不要请求此类账户</strong>。因为这些账户未在使用，请求只会徒增您的调用成本，并可能影响系统对您服务质量的评估。</li></ol><ol data-id=\"o3f343b3-B3e3OX73\" data-indent=\"1\" start=\"2\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Taw3T6gY\"><strong>30天无消耗账户</strong></li></ol><ol data-id=\"odaa5e75-AY7IDcSI\" data-indent=\"2\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-H7tHFgLl\"><strong>定义</strong>：仅指在近30天内没有营销消耗记录的账户。其中<strong>包括了不活跃的账户，但也可能包含有消耗潜力、正处于“冷启动”期的新账户或重启账户。</strong></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ZlSVn9rd\"><strong>策略与建议</strong>：系统会参考此类账户的占比来优化频控分配，<strong>其核心目标是鼓励您将资源集中在更有潜力的账户上</strong>。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-8mla0KZm\"><strong>请您放心</strong>，正常的账户冷启动行为不会被误判，我们支持您为<strong>新账户/重启账户</strong>提供合理的服务与请求。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-jDOTFfP0\"><strong>最佳实践</strong>：建议您建立账户分层模型，优先保障有消耗账户的请求资源。对于长期无消耗的账户，适当降低其请求频率，这将有助于您提升请求时效，并可能获得更高的开发者频控配额，可参考「<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/34/docs/1834161681551499?origin=left_nav\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">高频请求时效优化</a>」。</li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-WqV0x9kc\"><br/></p><ol data-id=\"o2efa9a6-VD369ej3\" start=\"3\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-dLjjyQQK\"><strong>Q: 如果不遵守规则，QPS会被降低吗？具体会降到多少？</strong></li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-dwYMLuOo\"><strong>A:</strong> 是的，持续产生无效请求（如频繁查询不活跃账户）可能导致：</p><ol data-id=\"oacb21b4-ot2ISj3A\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-4RtJEJgZ\">短期：暂不支持提升QPS（QPS保持不变）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-E0r2eU5Q\">长期：无效请求激增可能触发QPS降级（降幅因情况而异）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-zkrbQm47\">  避免方法：应用最佳实践（如延长非活跃账户查询间隔至天级），可参考以下文档：</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-pNRl4Oew\">基础实践：<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/34/docs/1696710758840332?origin=left_nav\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">频控限流器开发</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cxWMDcDL\">进阶实践：<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/34/docs/1834161681551499?origin=left_nav\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">高频请求时效优化</a></li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-o0HrDfo5\"><br/></p><ol data-id=\"ofc672e1-HQYbLEQX\" start=\"4\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-tLkmu1ih\"><strong>什么情况下开发者QPS支持提升？</strong></li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-Qf8PV3hU\"><strong>A:</strong> 系统将在<strong>每月1日与15日</strong>自动评估每位开发者的频控限额，<strong>并在「开发者后台-频控管理页面」更新频控状态</strong>，<strong>告知您在哪些接口下可提频/不可提频</strong>。我们将综合考量账户消耗水平、有消耗账户规模及请求成功率等多维度指标。建议您保持合理的操作请求频率，如您的服务表现良好，将有望获得配额提升。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-OHD2hDNz\"><br/></p><ol data-id=\"oc5f4d4e-1PRBBFPJ\" start=\"5\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-QfqWYgIR\"><strong>开发者频控配额的计算公式或评估标准具体是哪些？</strong><strong></strong></li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-QHT9gg8Q\"><strong>A：</strong>为保障平台系统安全和公平性，我们无法提供具体的评估计算公式，请您理解。该评估机制由多个维度综合计算得出，减少不活跃账户量级，保障请求合理性利于评估分配qps量级。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-gtI2D79U\"><br/></p><ol data-id=\"o608cf29-eNQT1NcR\" start=\"6\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-tM1f8BNG\"><strong>Q: QPS最高能提升多少倍？数据可信吗？</strong></li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-HMPTXRxc\"><strong>A:</strong> 接口不同QPS最大提升幅度不同，当达到最大可提升值时会有提示“已达最高配额”。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-0ZUEmycL\"><br/></p><ol data-id=\"ob138c93-UE054lSe\" start=\"7\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-thsoanQQ\"><strong>“近30天频控用量”指标的计算公式是什么？数据什么时候更新？我感到不准怎么办？</strong></li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-Fxa6bqCU\"><strong>A：</strong>“近30天频控用量”=您在该接口下近30天平均p95请求次数/您被分配的QPS</p><ol data-id=\"oacb21b4-7dSaBv5I\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-TE8m9OHP\">  该指标是您近期开发者频控用量情况的趋势性参考，主要用于帮助您了解大致的频控配额使用水平。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-JsnHdTQU\">更新频率：该<strong>指标并非实时值</strong>，每日更新一次</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-t2vAz4k4\">关于准确性：请注意，该指标是一个基于30天平滑计算的参考值，旨在反映长期趋势，因此<strong>不会与您感知到的实时峰值或短期波动完全吻合</strong>。实际请求时请根据返回的错误码（40110）或响应头X-RateLimit-Dimension等来判断是否已触发开发者频控限流，并据此调整您的调用策略。</li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-Ul73v6dM\"><br/></p><ol data-id=\"ob801cad-X5h4iM02\" start=\"8\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-UQm7acO1\"><strong>Q: 如何有效减少非活跃账户的请求？实践中有什么简单方法？</strong></li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-mnrwo9Ad\"><strong>A:</strong> 遵循“聚焦有效请求”原则：</p><ol data-id=\"oacb21b4-5oSSVejH\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ZObGdAMX\">延长查询间隔（如从每1小时改为每天1次）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-i79p9HeY\">使用接口的主动筛选能力（例如设置modify_time参数仅拉取新数据）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Ra4uzF0f\">接入平台SPI消息通知，仅当变更发生后定向请求，减少轮询</li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-7hNnpfkJ\"><br/></p><ol data-id=\"oc05498b-Yi1bbe5c\" start=\"9\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-7W11Tha4\"><strong>Q: 接入SPI消息通知复杂吗？需要额外成本吗？</strong></li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-e9rd2d9k\"><strong>A:</strong> 不复杂，提供符合接收要求的地址并创建订阅任务，符合订阅条件的消息会发送至指定地址，详情可参考：【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710547608591\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">SPI消息订阅</a>】</p><ol data-id=\"oacb21b4-RPjEAfS1\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-033AnP8g\">步骤：搭建回调地址→创建订阅任务配置回调URL→接收实时通知→仅触发必要请求</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-UytF3QyB\">好处：降低轮询负担30%，无需额外成本，只需一次接入。</li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-AboscwRJ\"><br/></p><ol data-id=\"o29bb15c-e1U8k0Ym\" start=\"10\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-iPuxZQ3T\"><strong>以前的开发者频控还有QPM、QPH，此类限制不存在了吗？</strong></li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-LjoOFfvE\"><strong>A: </strong>取消QPH惩罚机制，保留QPM惩罚机制并更新规则，目前按滑动窗口计算每分钟，开发者账户在该接口的总请求次数需＜开发者QPS配额*100，超过则将触发持续5分钟的报错惩罚(40110)</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-xpfIot4u\"><br/></p></div>",
  "doc_type": 1,
  "going_offline": false,
  "is_new": false,
  "path": null,
  "title": "频控限制"
}
